OL,3,GNEWSATown marks 125 years of Navy
OL,4,Asubmarine building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is commemorating more than a
OL,7,Fcentury of building submarines for the
OL,8,FRoyal Navy.
OL,10,FIt is 125 years since submarine
OL,11,Fconstruction began in the UK, with the
OL,12,Ffirst commissioned for the navy, the
OL,13,FHMS Holland 1, built in
OL,14,FBarrow-in-Furness in Cumbria in 1901.
OL,16,FHeritage advisor at BAE Systems, John
OL,17,FBulmer, said technology had "come on
OL,18,Fmassively" at the ship yard.
